\item For a simplicial operater $\delta : [m] \rightarrow [n]$, $M_T(\delta): (M_T)_n \rightarrow (M_T)_m$ is defined by: for each $(g,h,l,m) \in (M_T)_n$, $M_T(\delta)$,
\[
M_T(\delta)
\begin{pmatrix}
g(-,-)\\
